<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!-- ═══ DARK GLASS DESIGN SYSTEM ═══

         A preset is a seed now, not a dictionary. The colours come from Shared/FallbackPalette.axaml
         until ThemeService.ApplyCustomization lands, and from the M3 generator after that; the seed
         itself lives in Models/SeedPreset.cs (SeedPresetCatalog), not here (RemEx-2gjwn).

         THIS FILE IS A PURE MERGE NOW (RemEx-bnz2x). It used to also carry this preset's geometry
         (corner radius, border thickness, the elevation ramp) - the one thing colour-collapse left
         behind. Measured against ThemeService, all of that is overwritten on every apply too, right
         down to CardBorderThickness (SeedPresetCatalog.CardBorderThickness, written by SelectTheme),
         so there is nothing preset-specific left to declare. The file still exists as the base-theme
         resource AppTheme.BaseDarkGlass resolves to (ThemeService.BaseThemeUri / SwapBaseTheme) -
         that selection mechanism is unrelated to this bead and untouched by it.
    -->
    <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
        <ResourceInclude Source="avares://Remex.Desktop/Themes/Shared/FallbackPalette.axaml"/>
    </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
</ResourceDictionary>
